{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47100","headline":"送独孤处士 · 尚颜","name":"送独孤处士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万里去非忙，惟携贮药囊。\n山家消夜景，酒肆过年光。\n立鹤洲侵浪，喧蛬壁近床。\n谁人临上路，乞得变髭方。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"尚颜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47100.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47100","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}